  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rights-Based Alcohol and Drug Abuse Prevention Among Girls &amp; Young Women</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will aim at character building and relationship building within the families. It will also aim at economic empowerment and life skills development for girls by addressing their human rights. The girls and young women who are the primary recipients of the project will be trained in life skills that enable them to make informed decisions on drugs/alcohol and their human rights, including SRHR and protection against HIV/AIDS. Community development is essential for the project.</narrative>
  </description>
